WEBVTT

01:03.520 --> 01:06.810
If you value the lives of
your friends, don't move.

01:09.940 --> 01:14.990
<b><i>Revenge - The End</i></b>

01:14.700 --> 01:19.370
Just watch, and enjoy the show.

01:31.670 --> 01:36.840
I need to keep the two
of you busy...

01:44.770 --> 01:47.060
Stop squirming.

01:47.060 --> 01:50.110
Haven't you realized that
there's nothing you can do?

02:00.830 --> 02:02.620
This pain, and heat...

02:03.330 --> 02:04.870
where have I felt it before?

02:06.160 --> 02:06.960
Takeo!

02:07.710 --> 02:08.580
Takeo!

02:08.830 --> 02:09.960
Takeo!

02:20.890 --> 02:22.010
Takeo...

02:22.010 --> 02:23.100
I remember now!

02:23.600 --> 02:24.470
Hisako?

02:25.020 --> 02:26.640
Did you know him?

02:27.390 --> 02:31.020
He was the one I talked about
from the Sasaki Academy!

02:31.020 --> 02:33.150
He's the boy I used to
be friends with!

02:34.530 --> 02:36.070
Takeo, you can't!

02:36.940 --> 02:39.950
If you use your powers...

02:40.660 --> 02:42.410
the world will end!

02:47.370 --> 02:49.080
The world will end!?

02:49.960 --> 02:51.420
What's going on!?

02:56.340 --> 03:02.140
Takeo's power can manipulate
the reality around him.

03:02.140 --> 03:03.810
Warp reality!?

03:04.220 --> 03:05.470
Oh, yes.

03:05.470 --> 03:10.020
He can change the composition of liquids,
even distort space itself...

03:10.020 --> 03:11.100
Distort space!?

03:11.730 --> 03:17.240
Chemistry, physics,
all natural laws will be twisted...

03:17.240 --> 03:18.740
and collapse.

03:26.160 --> 03:27.330
What are you doing!?

03:27.330 --> 03:30.120
Can't you see you're
hurting Takeo?

03:30.420 --> 03:33.000
I'm making him feel pain...

03:33.000 --> 03:35.090
or at least, the illusion of it.

03:35.090 --> 03:36.550
What I?

03:36.880 --> 03:39.920
And if he wants the pain to stop...

03:39.920 --> 03:41.180
Takeo!

03:41.180 --> 03:44.430
Destroy everything!

03:51.440 --> 03:52.020
No!

03:52.770 --> 03:54.020
No, Takeo!

03:54.810 --> 03:58.360
Dr. Sasaki was crying then, too...

04:08.080 --> 04:11.290
<i>Hisako and Takeo are
the only ones left!</i>

04:22.510 --> 04:24.220
<i>No!</i>

04:37.730 --> 04:38.940
<i>Mom...</i>

04:39.530 --> 04:40.740
<i>I...</i>

04:41.440 --> 04:42.950
<i>I...</i>

04:43.820 --> 04:44.740
<i>Takeo...</i>

04:47.740 --> 04:49.370
It was so sad...

04:49.990 --> 04:52.500
we all cried,
and suffered together...

04:53.330 --> 04:55.580
...so how did I forget?

04:55.580 --> 05:01.760
An omega-class telepath could erase memories
of himself within other people.

05:02.670 --> 05:05.840
Especially if he inherited
his mental powers from Charles...

05:06.260 --> 05:08.100
Then Takeo made me forget?

05:08.100 --> 05:09.850
He hurt his friends,

05:10.930 --> 05:14.020
and felt like
he was a monster.

05:14.560 --> 05:17.560
He wanted people to
forget about him,

05:17.560 --> 05:20.900
and subconsciously blocked out
everyone's memories of him.

05:23.570 --> 05:24.700
Takeo...

05:25.530 --> 05:27.110
it must have been terrible.

05:27.660 --> 05:30.620
Having your powers hurt
your friends...

05:31.200 --> 05:35.790
But erasing yourself from
their memories...

05:39.840 --> 05:42.960
I closed the academy...

05:43.800 --> 05:46.470
hid Takeo from
the rest of the world,

05:46.470 --> 05:51.220
and worked desperately to
cope with his powers...

05:52.310 --> 05:54.980
I just wanted to protect him!

05:56.390 --> 06:00.610
Why didn't you ask Professor X,
and us, for help!?

06:01.610 --> 06:02.730
Takeo...

06:04.150 --> 06:07.450
the way he feels about Charles,
for fathering him...

06:08.490 --> 06:10.070
and me...

06:11.410 --> 06:13.200
his mother...

06:24.550 --> 06:27.220
Done with your confession?

06:31.260 --> 06:33.890
<i>Altitude: 2,000 meters and falling.</i>

06:36.890 --> 06:38.060
Charles.

06:40.270 --> 06:41.440
<i>Jean...</i>

06:42.270 --> 06:43.610
<i>is that you?</i>

06:44.900 --> 06:47.190
<i>Your students are in danger...</i>

06:48.490 --> 06:51.030
<i>you have to protect
the future of mutantkind.</i>

06:52.780 --> 06:53.910
<i>Charles!</i>

06:56.040 --> 06:59.040
<i>Altitude: 1,800 meters.</i>

07:05.300 --> 07:07.380
Was I hallucinating?

07:07.380 --> 07:08.050
Or perhaps...

07:09.970 --> 07:13.970
Either way,
this is no time for a nap...

07:14.890 --> 07:16.680
Isn't that right, Jean?

07:32.320 --> 07:35.160
Takeo, you can't use
your powers!

07:35.160 --> 07:40.960
Such a waste of potential,
locked in this hole!

07:44.960 --> 07:47.170
Bravo, Takeo!

07:47.920 --> 07:49.760
This is omega-class power!

07:50.220 --> 07:53.470
Taking over the world should be
simple with your help!

07:55.600 --> 07:57.100
<i>I won't forgive him!</i>

07:57.850 --> 08:01.390
<i>Takeo might have hurt
the people around him...</i>

08:01.810 --> 08:05.770
<i>but he was the one
who suffered the most.</i>

08:05.770 --> 08:09.820
<i>Because of his powers,
he became all alone...</i>

08:10.950 --> 08:13.240
<i>And you're trying to manipulate
those powers! ?</i>

08:13.570 --> 08:14.870
I won't forgive you!

08:42.600 --> 08:44.060
My body...

08:44.060 --> 08:46.400
you little bitch, how dare you!

09:09.460 --> 09:11.130
Useless...

09:12.550 --> 09:15.180
The rookie's hard at work,

09:15.180 --> 09:19.810
so we better not hang around strung up like this for much longer!

09:20.260 --> 09:21.720
I concur.

09:23.270 --> 09:27.480
We'll need to do something
about his sensory amplification power.

09:27.900 --> 09:30.320
Our nervous systems can't
take much more of this.

09:30.900 --> 09:31.650
Takeo!

09:35.320 --> 09:36.110
Hisako!

09:36.910 --> 09:39.450
Mastermind is mine.

09:39.870 --> 09:40.950
Cyclops?

09:41.410 --> 09:42.910
Oh, really?

09:44.960 --> 09:46.330
Hisako, get down!

10:38.840 --> 10:40.050
Jean!

10:44.600 --> 10:45.430
Jean...

10:46.310 --> 10:47.850
what's going on?

10:48.560 --> 10:51.060
What happened to everyone?

10:51.060 --> 10:52.360
It's your fault...

10:53.520 --> 10:54.940
My fault?

10:55.860 --> 10:59.820
Because you didn't kill me last year...

11:01.030 --> 11:03.700
Because I didn't...

11:06.450 --> 11:11.170
This is the future that
you created for mutants...

11:13.380 --> 11:14.460
No...

11:15.550 --> 11:17.880
It's all your fault.

11:18.260 --> 11:19.550
Cyclops!

11:23.470 --> 11:24.100
This is bad!

11:24.600 --> 11:26.350
He's trapped in the illusion!

11:26.350 --> 11:27.390
Emma!

11:27.390 --> 11:28.560
Break the illusion!

11:28.560 --> 11:29.440
I can't!

11:29.980 --> 11:33.400
I can't use my telepathy
in this diamond form.

11:34.230 --> 11:37.610
And if I do turn back to normal,

11:37.610 --> 11:42.160
he'll use my telepathy to
make the illusion even stronger!

11:42.450 --> 11:44.780
Very perceptive, Emma.

11:44.780 --> 11:48.580
Then we'll have to
take him out first!

11:50.620 --> 11:51.370
What is this!?

11:56.960 --> 11:59.760
Takeo...

12:11.810 --> 12:12.600
Emma!

12:12.940 --> 12:13.810
Hisako!

12:21.150 --> 12:24.570
This is the future
I created for mutants?

12:25.200 --> 12:25.950
Yes.

12:26.410 --> 12:27.660
It's your fault.

12:35.130 --> 12:36.790
All your fault.

12:38.090 --> 12:39.260
Yours!

12:40.090 --> 12:41.470
Stop!

12:46.260 --> 12:47.350
This is bad!

12:47.810 --> 12:48.470
Beast!

12:50.270 --> 12:54.480
Next time he gets
his tentacles in me, hit me!

12:54.480 --> 12:55.690
And don't stop!

12:55.980 --> 12:56.900
Hard as you can!

12:57.310 --> 12:58.860
What are you talking about!?

12:58.860 --> 13:02.820
No other way to take
this sadistic dirtbag down...

13:03.700 --> 13:06.410
Let's take it over the edge.

13:07.620 --> 13:09.120
But if I do that...

13:09.120 --> 13:10.620
Just do it!

13:11.870 --> 13:13.460
Bring it on, bub!

13:15.330 --> 13:19.090
I don't know what you're up to,
but if you insist!

13:21.050 --> 13:22.050
NOW!

13:27.930 --> 13:28.680
Wolverine!

13:28.680 --> 13:29.930
Keep going!

13:29.930 --> 13:30.930
Hit me!

13:38.650 --> 13:40.480
Imbecile.

14:08.970 --> 14:10.800
What are youl?

14:15.600 --> 14:17.100
<i>He...</i>

14:17.100 --> 14:18.350
<i>he's lost his mind!</i>

14:18.350 --> 14:20.310
<i>Has this guy lost
all sensation of pain?</i>

14:20.440 --> 14:23.320
You monster!

14:30.620 --> 14:31.990
You bastard!

14:38.870 --> 14:39.630
He did it!

14:44.300 --> 14:45.170
That's enough!

14:45.510 --> 14:46.590
Wolverine!

14:47.220 --> 14:48.680
It's over, Wolverine!

14:51.470 --> 14:52.180
Wolverine!

14:53.310 --> 14:54.010
Wolverine!

14:54.390 --> 14:56.180
Snap out of it, Wolverine!

14:57.100 --> 14:58.390
Logan!

15:03.940 --> 15:05.110
Howdy.

15:05.530 --> 15:08.530
Was that a secondary mutation?

15:08.530 --> 15:10.860
It made Damon Hall Syndrome
look like a head cold...

15:11.490 --> 15:13.660
maybe I should
vaccinate you again.

15:14.330 --> 15:17.000
Go ahead, bub,
but I don't think it's gonna help.

15:17.000 --> 15:17.580
Yeowch!

15:18.410 --> 15:21.130
That took a lot out of me.

15:24.170 --> 15:28.760
My dear X-Men,
it's time for you to die.

15:29.220 --> 15:31.680
We'll start with your
fearless leader.

15:31.970 --> 15:32.890
Cyclops!

15:32.890 --> 15:33.890
Snap out of it!

15:34.350 --> 15:35.600
Cyclops!

15:36.100 --> 15:37.060
Cyclops!

15:43.810 --> 15:45.690
The future you've chosen
was filled with...

15:46.230 --> 15:47.280
despair!

15:52.450 --> 15:55.580
Now, you too shall
sleep in despair.

16:10.470 --> 16:11.550
Jean!?

16:12.930 --> 16:13.720
Who!?

16:14.890 --> 16:16.010
Who are you!?

16:19.100 --> 16:20.060
Is that you, Jean!?

16:23.310 --> 16:24.060
Shoot me.

16:24.860 --> 16:25.860
That's...

16:26.610 --> 16:29.490
This is just how it
happened last time!

16:30.570 --> 16:31.450
Shoot.

16:32.700 --> 16:34.110
Don't do it, Cyclops!

16:34.870 --> 16:37.240
I can't do it!

16:37.830 --> 16:38.830
You have to.

16:38.830 --> 16:40.250
Don't, Cyclops!

16:40.250 --> 16:41.290
Don't shoot me!

16:41.710 --> 16:42.710
Cyclops!

16:43.500 --> 16:44.630
Cyclops!

16:45.380 --> 16:45.500
Please, shoot.

16:45.500 --> 16:46.790
Please, shoot.
Cyclops!

16:46.790 --> 16:47.500
Please, shoot.
No!

16:47.500 --> 16:47.540
No!
Shoot me.

16:47.540 --> 16:48.590
Don't!
Shoot me.

16:48.590 --> 16:48.750
Cyclops!
Shoot me.

16:48.750 --> 16:49.760
Cyclops!

16:50.050 --> 16:50.920
I...

16:51.590 --> 16:54.760
Don't do it, Cyclops!

16:55.300 --> 16:57.050
Fire away, Scott.

16:58.640 --> 16:59.600
Jean...

17:16.530 --> 17:17.450
Cyclops!

17:17.450 --> 17:18.700
He did it!

17:18.700 --> 17:22.000
How did you break
that illusion!?

17:25.000 --> 17:25.870
Jean...

17:26.290 --> 17:30.250
all this time,
I must have been regretting

17:30.250 --> 17:36.300
the fact that I couldn't end your suffering
when you begged me to.

17:37.590 --> 17:42.520
You showed me the way,
even in an illusion.

17:42.980 --> 17:44.180
Stern as ever.

17:45.560 --> 17:46.190
I'm ready.

17:47.190 --> 17:51.190
I can finally say goodbye to you.

17:52.690 --> 17:55.570
Don't get so excited about
breaking a simple illusion!

17:56.490 --> 18:00.530
I still have the immense
power of Takeo to-

18:06.670 --> 18:07.670
What's this?

18:11.420 --> 18:12.420
Impossible!

18:12.420 --> 18:14.050
This power is mine!

18:14.050 --> 18:15.170
I'm going to...

18:15.670 --> 18:16.300
Don't!

18:16.300 --> 18:17.880
Stop it!

18:33.150 --> 18:33.980
Takeo!

18:33.980 --> 18:35.280
You can't get near him!

18:45.830 --> 18:46.830
It's falling apart!

18:46.830 --> 18:47.710
Everybody outside!

18:53.710 --> 18:54.550
That's...

18:57.970 --> 19:00.390
<i>Incoming turbulence detected.</i>

19:00.390 --> 19:01.430
<i>Warning.</i>

19:03.640 --> 19:05.180
I'm going to make
my way through!

19:24.080 --> 19:28.000
If his power's range extends
to the entire world...

19:28.000 --> 19:30.210
It'll all be over.

19:30.210 --> 19:32.540
We gotta stop him here.

19:33.000 --> 19:35.250
Are we gonna attack Takeo?

19:35.710 --> 19:36.420
Don't!

19:36.420 --> 19:38.260
Don't hurt him!

19:38.260 --> 19:41.130
At this rate, more and
more people will suffer.

19:41.130 --> 19:43.300
Takeo will be hurt in the end.

19:43.680 --> 19:45.760
You should know that by now!

19:54.610 --> 19:55.270
The sky!

19:59.280 --> 20:00.820
What was that just now!?

20:01.360 --> 20:04.030
Enough power to
destroy the world...

20:04.620 --> 20:05.990
is that Takeo's mutation!?

20:29.430 --> 20:30.520
We're taking him down!

20:30.520 --> 20:31.060
Split up!

20:32.440 --> 20:34.810
I can't...

20:34.810 --> 20:36.230
Take Yui and get back!

20:44.280 --> 20:45.530
My head...

21:11.350 --> 21:12.390
Charles.

23:01.630 --> 23:04.590
The world approaches
its destruction.

23:07.510 --> 23:12.970
With few options left,
the X-Men fall one after another.

23:14.680 --> 23:18.940
In a cruel twist of fate,
a father is pitted against his son.

23:20.270 --> 23:21.650
How will it end?

23:22.150 --> 23:23.110
What of the future?

23:24.900 --> 23:31.070
<b><i>Destiny - Connections</i></b>

23:24.900 --> 23:28.650
Next time on X-Men: Connections.
